### Configuration

The extraction script uses GraphQL fragments for ITComponent-specific fields:

```python
TECHNOLOGY_STACK_QUERY = """
query TechnologyStackExport($filter: FilterInput) {
  allFactSheets(
    factSheetType: ITComponent
    filter: $filter
  ) {
    edges {
      node {
        ... on ITComponent {
          relITComponentToTechnologyStack {
            edges {
              node {
                factSheet {
                  ... on TechnicalStack {
                    relToParent {
                      # Hierarchical category navigation
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
"""
```
